## 13. Performance & Polish Techniques

### Image Optimization
- All images served via **Cloudinary CDN** with automatic format conversion (WebP/AVIF)
- Unsplash URLs used with `?w=800` parameter to limit download size
- `object-cover` + `group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700` for subtle zoom on hover

### Skeleton Loading States
Every data-driven component shows skeletons instead of spinners:
```jsx
{isLoading ? (
  <span className="block h-16 bg-muted animate-pulse rounded-md w-full" />
) : (
  <p>{description}</p>
)}
```

### Custom Scrollbar
```css
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  @apply bg-victor-navy/10 rounded-full hover:bg-victor-navy/25;
}
```

### Color Transition on Theme Switch
```css
html, body {
  transition: color 700ms ease-in-out, background-color 700ms ease-in-out;
}
```

### Font Feature Settings
```css
body {
  font-feature-settings: "cv02", "cv03", "cv04", "ss01", "kern";
}
```
This enables OpenType features like contextual alternates and stylistic sets in Inter, making text subtly more polished.

