## Appendix: Quick Reference Card

### CSS Class Cheatsheet
```
Rounded corners:    rounded-2xl (cards), rounded-3xl (hero tiles), rounded-full (pills)
Shadows:            shadow-sm (cards), shadow-xl (CTAs), bento-shadow (floating)
Glass:              glass (standard), glass-premium (extra blur), glass-dark (dark mode)
Typography:         font-display font-black (headings), font-body font-medium (prose)
Labels:             text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground
Borders:            border-black/[0.03] (light), border-white/5 (dark)
Hover:              group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700
```

### Animation Cheatsheet
```
Stagger entrance:   variants={containerVariants} + variants={itemVariants}
Scroll trigger:     whileInView="visible" viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-100px" }}
Card lift:          whileHover={{ y: -6 }}
Spring physics:     transition={{ type: "spring", stiffness: 300, damping: 24 }}
Infinite loop:      transition={{ duration: 20, repeat: Infinity, ease: "linear" }}
```

### React Query Cheatsheet
```
Fetch:    useQuery({ queryKey: ['key'], queryFn: async () => api.get('/endpoint') })
Mutate:   useMutation({ mutationFn, onSuccess: () => queryClient.invalidateQueries(['key']) })
Prefetch: queryClient.prefetchQuery({ queryKey: ['key'], queryFn })
```

